  "starterCode": "# Multi-head Latent Attention — reconstructed educational contract\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef solution(x, down, up):\n    # TODO: implement the operation described in the problem statement\n    pass\n",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Multi-head Latent Attention** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(x, down, up):\n    # Educational latent attention projection: compress to latent, then reconstruct heads/features.\n    z=np.asarray(x,dtype=float)@np.asarray(down,dtype=float)\n    return {\"latent\":z.tolist(),\"reconstructed\":(z@np.asarray(up,dtype=float)).tolist()}\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
